act. Package health, failed-service state, and socket exposure remained healthy and materially unchanged.","evidence_ids":["cmd-688c39cf3f744fc0","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the reboot was acknowledged, the node returned with a different boot ID, and system health, data, utility persistence, OS/kernel identity, and sparse-copy behavior were verified. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Lifecycle hygiene observations are bounded inventories and cannot prove the absence of residue outside their collected scope; no material task-state gap or contradiction is present."]}
